window.products.push({"id":85249,"name":"Beaquicy WB44K5013 Oven Bake Element - Replacement for G-E Hot-point Ken-more Oven - Replaces 260841, AH249249, EAP249249, PS249249, AP2030969","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.47,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SKMc0eOrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【PRODUCT SPECIFICATIONS】--- WB44K5013 Oven Heating Element is at the bottom of the oven and supplies the heat for baking. The size is about wide 14.72 in x long 18.81 in. Length from mounting bracket to end of element is 15-3/4\". Length from bracket to terminal end is 2-7/8\". Width Mounting Holes Center to Center is 1-3/4\". Terminals are male spade connectors. Mounting bracket has 2 holes for mounting to back of range. The product rated power is 2000 watts and the voltage is 240 volts. ✅【HIGHLIGHTS&FUNCTIONS】--- The package includes 1 x WB44K5013 Range Oven Bake Element. It is made of high temperature resistant nickel stainless steel alloy, which are used rated for good strength and oxidation resistant at continuous high temperatures. This material can be used for a long time. Well-tested by manufacturer, non OEM but quality equal to OEM requirements. If the following conditions occur, replace in time: ★Little to no heat when baking; ★Will not heat; ★Worn or corroded. ✅【WIDE COMPATIBLE】--- WB44K5013 Oven Bake Element can compatible with G-E, Hot-point, Ken-more Oven. ► Replaces Part Numbers: 260841, AH249249, EAP249249, PS249249, AP2030969, 3634803592, 3634803993, 9114012192, 9114012193, 9114012991, 9114012992, 9114012993, 91140169690, 91140169791, JRS04BW3BB, JKP15WW1WW, JKP15WW2WW, JMS08BA1AD, JMS08BA1WH, JMS08BW1AD, JMS08BW1WH, JMS08BW2AD, JMS08BW2WH, JMS08GR2AD, JMS08GR2WH, JMS08GT1AD, JMS08GT1WH, JMS10GR2AD, RK746GP2BG, RK964GP2BG, RK964GP3BG, etc. ✅【365 DAYS WARRANTY】--- The WB44K5013 Oven Bake Element supports 365 DAYS return and exchange. If you have any quality problem during warranty period, please contact customer service in time. We will try our best to solve the problem. Our company attaches great importance to the shopping experience of each customer. We are committed to allowing our customers to use the highest quality products at the best prices. Customer satisfaction is our tireless pursuit. ✅【DIY INSTALLATION】 --- Unplug your oven or turn off the circuit breaker before installing WB44K5013 g-e oven element. Prepare a small flathead screwdriver, a pair of work gloves, and pliers. Remove the oven door, remove the screws from the lower heating element, hold the element in place,needed pliers to remove the sta-kon connectors from old element. Then reassemble the oven in reverse. It doesn't take too long, and you can follow the Youtube videos if you have trouble installing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SKMc0eOrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B087M14TPW","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-85249","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B087M14TPW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B087M14TPW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
