window.products.push({"id":85338,"name":"2023 Upgraded DC97-05280W Washer Suspension Rods by Beaquicy - Suitable for Samsung Washing Machine Model wa50r5400av/us, wa45h7000aw/02, wa456drhdsu/","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":40.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611wgIcUePL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【4pcs OF 26.18’’ SUSPENSION RODS】washer suspension rod will slowly undergo plastic creep at a certain temperature and under a certain stress, resulting in inconsistent spring strength, followed by the problem of unbalanced load throwing error codes such as UR, UB, UE, etc. The spin cycle will start over and over again without spinning all the time,►Replacing the 4 x suspension rods DC97-05280W often corrects Samsung washing machines that go out of balance and display the these error code. ✅【SPRING WITH BLACK BRACKET】DC97-05280W rods supports acts as shock absorber,allowing the washtub to move while helping to reduce vibration in rotating mode.When vibration occurs during washing or dewatering,the suspension will swing along the sphere on one hand and slide up and down along the boom on the other hand to absorb the vibration energy,thus reducing the vibration noise of the box ►2023 Upgraded Rods spring with black bracket design allows the washer to run smoothly even at high speed ✅【5 YEARS WARRANTY】4 suspension rods SUPPORTS 5 YEARS RETURN/EXCHANGE. ►THIS KIT PACKAGE INCLUDES 4 PIECES 26.18INCHES WASHER SUSPENSION RODS DC97-05280W and⚠️fix the following symptoms:Washer is out of balance. DC,UR,UB,UE,error. Will not complete a very light load. Vibrates or shakes very violently. ►Replacing the 4 suspension rods often corrects Samsung washer that go out of balance and display the error code.If one or more of the suspension rods are broken,the washer will vibrate or shake. ✅【FOR SAMSUNG TOP-LOAD WASHERS】Upgraded DC97-05280W washer suspension rod kit is suitable for Samsung top-load washers in the WA400, WA40J, WA456, WA45H and WA45M series. ►Replace for wa5471abwxaa01,wa422prhdwr/aa 01,wa422prdwr/aa02,wa456drhdsu/aa, wa45m3100aw/a4,wa400pjhdwr/aa02,wa400pjhdwr/aa01,wa422prhdwr/aa-02, wa48j7770aw/a2,wa45m75aw/a4,wa50f9a7dsw,wa45h7000aw/a2,wa50f9a7d,wa16j6710lw and more. If one or more of the suspension rods are broken, the washer will vibrate or shake. ✅【EASY TO INSTALL】The installation of 4pcs DC97-05280W washer suspension rods is simple,You should prepare the helpful tools include: a screwdriver, a pair of work gloves.①Unplug the washer before installing this part.Wear work gloves to protect your hands.②Be very careful of the grease used on the pivot points. It is very difficult to remove.③The process takes about 20 ~ 30 minutes. Pay attention to safety.Maintenance personnel or yourself can install the installation quickly and easily.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611wgIcUePL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B08FHTYVBS","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-85338","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FHTYVBS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FHTYVBS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
