window.products.push({"id":85617,"name":"Appliance Pros Flexible Stainless Steel Gas Line for Dryer, Gas Hose Connector Kit, Comes with 1/2\" OD 1/2\" MIP x 1/2\" FIP, Stainless Steel (4 FOOT)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+IkCiqgyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MADE FOR YOUR GAS DRYERS - Appliance Pros' Flexible Dryer Vent Hose features quality tubing that's mainly designed for gas dryers. Not intended for gas range or ovens. It measures 48 inches with male and female iron pipes. HIGHLY FLEXIBLE - Featuring its corrugated design, you'll achieve full flexibility as this corrugated gas appliance connector can fit and snake into small spaces including corners and bends. What's more, it also has a bright yellow color that offers increased identification and visibility. GREAT QUALITY - This corrugated stainless steel gas dryer hose has compression fittings to create a secure metal connection for heavy-duty use. The corrosion-resistant material and no-neck design make for seamless operation and longevity. A must-have connector kit for most gas dryers. HASSLE-FREE INSTALLATION - You don't need to hire someone to conveniently install this hose connector kit for your gas dryer. No tools required too. The male and female iron pipes allow easy connections to your appliance. Just make sure your sizing fits the gas pipings. It connects the gas dryer line to your dryer duct with ease. ONE YEAR WARRANTY - With no compromise to quality, we provide premium durable products for the long-term, which is a seal to ultimate safety. This item has been quality tested and is backed by the Appliance Pros 1 Year Limited Warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+IkCiqgyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Appliance Pros","source_asin":"B09FJHQT8H","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-85617","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FJHQT8H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FJHQT8H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
