window.products.push({"id":85710,"name":"Melitta #2 Cone Coffee Filters, Natural Brown, 40 Count","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":5.09,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81PDB986jDL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our founder, Melitta Bentz, invented coffee filters and pour-over brewing in 1908. For over 100 years, Melitta has remained a pioneer in coffee, coffee filters and coffee brewers. Our paper filters are 100% biodegradable. We offer filters for cone, flat bottom basket, percolators and Keurig single serve coffee brewers. Our filters are produced using chlorine-free white, natural brown and bamboo paper. In addition to filters, we offer a wide range of coffees and brewers including pour- overs, carafes, pour-over kits, coffee makers, kettles, drip coffeemakers, and even our own premium, batch-roasted coffee. Our coffee beans are sourced from farms located in prime coffee-producing regions. We batch roast and grind our beans extra fine in true European fashion - bringing out the coffee's full flavor. Enjoy our entire range of ground coffees, whole bean coffees, and single serve coffee pods.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81PDB986jDL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Melitta","source_asin":"B000QJXOAS","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-85710","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000QJXOAS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B000QJXOAS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":85711,"name":"AppliaFit Dryer Drum Belt Compatible With Samsung Dryer Drum Belt 6602-001655. (2-Pack)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81C4BFAYdBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Replacing your dryer drum belt is a quick and easy fix for your Samsung dryer, using your AppliaFit 6602-001655 dryer drum belt. This dryer drum belt attaches to a pulley system which is what turns the drum during your drying cycle. The dryer belt goes in between the dryer motor and the dryer drum. If your dryer belt breaks, the dryer will no longer work like it should. Replacing the dryer belt can fix the following problems: - Dryer making loud noises - Dryer not starting - Dryer won’t tumble - Dryer can't produce enough heat - Dryer won't heat up at all Check to ensure your Samsung dryer is compatible by using this list of current models: DV431AEW/XAA-002, DV306LEW/XAA, DV431AGP/XAA-0001, DV306LGW/XAA, DV431AGP/XAA-0002, DV203AEW/XAA-0000, DV431AGW/XAA-0001, DV203AGS/XAA-0000, DV431AGW/XAA-0002, DV203AGW/XAA-0000, DV433ETGJWR/A1 (0000), DV206AES/XAA-0000, DV433GTGJWR/A1-0000, DV206AGS/XAA-0000, and DV433GTGJWR/A1-0001. Often times the same part may have different numbers, this part is compatible to replace the following: 6602-001655, 5PH2337, B001KGX5G4, AP4373659, 1935594, 935594, PS4133825, 602-001314, and 1935594. Packaging may vary.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81C4BFAYdBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AppliaFit","source_asin":"B087LVM6LD","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-85711","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B087LVM6LD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B087LVM6LD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
